  "description": "Terminal UI for .NET and PowerShell with no package dependencies: tables, trees, panels and charts,\n            live runs and dashboards with thread-safe updates, menus, prompts and forms, and exports to HTML, SVG\n            and text. It detects colour, glyphs and window size, and writes plain lines when output is redirected.\n            For .NET 8 and .NET 10, .NET Standard 2.0 and .NET Framework 4.7.2.",
